Cell["For integer shifts j,k, f0(x+j,x+k)/f0(x,x) is \
shiftRatio[j,k,x]. Applying this recurrence before FullSimplify reduces the \
loop algebra to rational functions. Define G = f0(-I nu,-I nu), and express \
all loop factors below in units of G.", "Text", ExpressionUUID ->
          "7b6016c9-5ae8-644f-a6f7-e16582b439a5"],

