Cell["\<\
The original regulated P2 definitions and all executable statements from \
P2_reg0_analytic.wl are included below. No external file is imported by these \
cells. Here reg0 denotes epsilon and nu0 is an intermediate symbolic mass \
index. The epsilon^0 Laurent coefficient is evaluated before introducing the \
common hypergeometric basis. Exact hypergeometric parameter derivatives are \
retained in the full outputs.\
\>", "Text",
 CellTags->
  "InlineP2-introduction",ExpressionUUID->"4d0da89b-fa89-4381-be5d-\
b51a3318371f"],

